            <div class="md:col-span-1 text-center hidden md:block">
              <span class="bg-red-100 text-red-600 text-xs font-bold px-2 py-1 rounded">공지</span>
            </div>
            <div class="md:col-span-2 text-left md:text-center text-sm font-medium">
              <span class="bg-primary/10 text-primary text-xs px-2 py-1 rounded inline-block">Best</span>
            </div>
            <div class="md:col-span-6">
              <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="text-base font-semibold text-text-dark">[필독] 2026학년도 최종 합격수기 모음집 사전 신청 안내</span>
                <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-accent" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15.172 7l-6.586 6.586a2 2 0 102.828 2.828l6.414-6.586a4 4 0 00-5.656-5.656l-6.415 6.585a6 6 0 108.486 8.486L20.5 13"></path></svg>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="md:col-span-2 text-left md:text-center text-sm text-text-muted mt-2 md:mt-0">관리자</div>
            <div class="md:col-span-1 text-left md:text-center text-xs text-text-muted">1,240</div>
          </div>
        </a>

        <!-- Normal Items -->
        <a href="#" class="block hover:bg-gray-50 transition-colors">
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-x-4 gap-y-2 p-4 items-center">
            <div class="md:col-span-1 text-center hidden md:block text-text-muted text-sm">421</div>
            <div class="md:col-span-2 text-left md:text-center">
              <span class="inline-block border border-border text-text-body text-xs px-2 py-1 rounded w-max">헝가리 / 세멜바이스</span>
            </div>
            <div class="md:col-span-6">
              <span class="text-base font-medium text-text-dark">기초부터 탄탄하게! 6개월 단기 완성으로 합격했습니다.</span>
            </div>
            <div class="md:col-span-2 text-left md:text-center text-sm text-text-muted flex md:justify-center items-center gap-2">
              <div class="w-6 h-6 bg-gray-200 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold text-gray-500" aria-hidden="true">김</div>
              김OO 학생
            </div>
            <div class="md:col-span-1 text-left md:text-center text-xs text-text-muted hidden md:block">312</div>
          </div>
        </a>

        <a href="#" class="block hover:bg-gray-50 transition-colors bg-white/50">
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-x-4 gap-y-2 p-4 items-center">
            <div class="md:col-span-1 text-center hidden md:block text-text-muted text-sm">420</div>
            <div class="md:col-span-2 text-left md:text-center">
              <span class="inline-block border border-border text-text-body text-xs px-2 py-1 rounded w-max">몽골 / MNUMS</span>
            </div>
            <div class="md:col-span-6">
              <span class="text-base font-medium text-text-dark">선생님들의 꼼꼼한 케어 덕분에 인터뷰 통과했습니다</span>
            </div>
            <div class="md:col-span-2 text-left md:text-center text-sm text-text-muted flex md:justify-center items-center gap-2">
              <div class="w-6 h-6 bg-gray-200 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold text-gray-500" aria-hidden="true">이</div>
              이OO 학생
            </div>
            <div class="md:col-span-1 text-left md:text-center text-xs text-text-muted hidden md:block">189</div>
          </div>
        </a>

        <a href="#" class="block hover:bg-gray-50 transition-colors">
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-x-4 gap-y-2 p-4 items-center text-text-muted">
            <div class="md:col-span-1 text-center hidden md:block text-sm">419</div>
            <div class="md:col-span-2 text-left md:text-center">
              <span class="inline-block border border-border text-xs px-2 py-1 rounded w-max">미국 / SGU</span>
            </div>
            <div class="md:col-span-6 flex items-center text-text-muted">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 mr-2" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 15v2m-6 4h12a2 2 0 002-2v-6a2 2 0 00-2-2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2zm10-10V7a4 4 0 00-8 0v4h8z"></path></svg>
              비밀글입니다.
            </div>
            <div class="md:col-span-2 text-left md:text-center text-sm flex md:justify-center items-center gap-2">
              <div class="w-6 h-6 bg-gray-200 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold text-gray-500" aria-hidden="true">박</div>
              박OO 학생
            </div>
            <div class="md:col-span-1 text-left md:text-center text-xs hidden md:block">88</div>
          </div>
